power_primary -- EXPLORATORY: development data, not evidence for any claim
confirmatory structure: 25 games (scripts/suite.py), S_M 2: 3 games, 3: 12 games, 4: 7 games, 5: 3 games
4000 simulated studies of 25 clusters of 5 units each, seed 20261114, 8 chunks; between-game pairs; normal approximation of scripts/sdd.py

